---
description: Prefer official documentation for frameworks and libraries in this monorepo. Use @Docs when available. Scope by path (phone app / shared / Convex).
alwaysApply: false
globs: ["apps/**/*", "packages/**/*", "convex/**/*"]
---

When implementing features, fixing bugs, or answering questions:

1. **Prefer official documentation** for the relevant framework or library. Do not rely only on generic or outdated patterns.
2. **Use @Docs** when the user has added doc sites (Cursor Settings → Indexing & Docs). Choose the doc that matches the task (e.g. Expo for the phone app, Convex for the backend).
3. **Stack and canonical doc URLs** are in project root **AGENTS.md**. Use that list for the correct docs to reference.
4. **Scope by path:** `apps/mobile-app` → Expo, Expo Router, Expo UI, React Native, NativeWind. `packages/shared` → Zod, shared types. `convex/` → Convex server functions, schema, and scheduled jobs. Show data comes from the TVmaze API (https://www.tvmaze.com/api).

If the user has not added official docs to @Docs yet, suggest adding the URLs from AGENTS.md.